          "id": 1,
          "author": "Claude",
          "created": 1788583954,
          "body": "Fixed: filter_menu_open, status_menu_open, and user_menu_open (\"Acting as\" popover) were independent booleans that only partially closed each other (filter/status closed each other, but neither closed user_menu, and user_menu closed neither). Each toggle site now resets the other two flags, so opening any one dropdown dismisses the others. Changed crates/pm-ui/src/status_bar.rs and crates/pm-ui/src/tickets_view.rs.",
