          "body": "Shipped in commit c04f5bf. `find_tickets` at tickets_view.rs:78-85 — no-ops unless `view == View::Tickets` (:79), opens the search box and focuses it (:83). Bound to `ctrl-f` in src/main.rs:88. Closing.",
